From 451f31ccb4fc21d90140c0114eef0636a2db08e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fxzx micah <48860358+fxzxmicah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:26:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: Make libwacom and Samba support optional

Add explicit build options for libwacom and Samba, enabled by default.

Disabling libwacom skips its dependency and the complete Wacom panel.
Disabling Samba skips smbclient and both Samba implementations, and
removes Samba discovery, authentication, device, and URI code paths
from the printers panel.
---
 meson.build                                   |  18 +-
 meson_options.txt                             |   2 +
 panels/meson.build                            |   9 +-
 panels/printers/meson.build                   |  29 ++-
 panels/printers/pp-new-printer-dialog.c       | 176 +++++++++++++-----
 panels/printers/pp-new-printer-dialog.ui      | 143 --------------
 panels/printers/pp-print-device.c             |  20 +-
